    <briefdescription>
<para>RAII wrapper for GPU memory allocations. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Wraps a pointer to GPU memory and ensures it&apos;s freed on destruction. Integrates with the GPU memory manager for proper lifecycle management.</para>
<para>Exception-safe: destructor is noexcept.</para>
<para>Note: This is a simplified wrapper for manual GPU memory. For tracked allocations, use <ref refid="classthemis_1_1llm_1_1_g_p_u_memory_manager_1a31ef15fd28c68b9be80250c577a5f032" kindref="member">GPUMemoryManager::allocateGPU()</ref> which returns pointers managed by MemoryHolder. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
